# Build-context filter for packages/control-plane/Dockerfile (BuildKit reads
# <Dockerfile>.dockerignore). The image needs only the root manifests plus the
# contracts, control-plane and cli workspace packages.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
**/.turbo
**/*.db
**/*.db-shm
**/*.db-wal
.git
.github
.claude
site
apps
docs
experimental
scripts
packages/ui
packages/mcp
packages/control-plane/fixtures
packages/cli/tests
packages/cli/examples
